~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:2:name: principle-prove-it-works
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:3:description: "Apply after completing a task, before declaring done. Verify against the real artifact (run the feature, read the actual value, inspect the diff), not a proxy, self-report, or 'it compiles.'"
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:4:---
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:6:# Prove It Works
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:8:Verify every task output by checking the real thing directly. Do not infer from proxies, self-reports, or "it compiles."
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:10:**Why:** Unverified work has unknown correctness. Indirect verification (file mtimes, output freshness, agent self-reports, cached screenshots) feels cheaper than direct observation. Acting on a wrong inference costs far more than checking the source.
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:12:Check the real thing, not a proxy:
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:13:- Check process liveness directly, not indirectly through derived state
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:14:- Read the actual value, not a cached or derived representation
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:15:- When verification fails, suspect the observation method before suspecting the system
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:17:## Script the check when you can
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:19:The strongest proof is a deterministic script that re-runs the same comparison, not a one-time eyeball. Write the script, run it, and keep its output as an artifact a reviewer can re-run instead of trusting your word.
~/.agents/skills/principle-prove-it-works/SKILL.md:21:Keep the artifact visible for the human: paste the command and its output in the reply or the final report. Keep throwaway scripts in a temp folder outside the repo. Don't commit a log or evidence file; a check worth keeping becomes a real test.
